## Proposed Changes

### Architecture Overview

```
3 Roles:
├── Admin          → Verify coordinators, system analytics, user management
├── Coordinator    → Brgy official (must be verified by admin first)
│                    Storage analytics, logistics, evacuation, request needs
└── Donor/Volunteer → Pledge supplies, claim tasks, track donations
```

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Landing Page] --> B{Has Account?}
    B -->|No| C[Register]
    B -->|Yes| D[Login]
    C --> E{Role Selected}
    E -->|Coordinator| F[Pending Verification]
    E -->|Donor/Volunteer| G[Donor Dashboard]
    E -->|Admin| H[Admin Dashboard]
    D --> I{Verified?}
    I -->|Coordinator - Pending| F
    I -->|Coordinator - Approved| J[Coordinator Dashboard]
    I -->|Coordinator - Rejected| K[Appeal Page]
    I -->|Admin| H
    I -->|Donor/Volunteer| G
    F -->|Admin Approves| J
    F -->|Admin Rejects| K
    K -->|Resubmit| F
    D -->|Forgot Password| L[Forgot Password Flow]
```

