### 1. State Management (store.js)

#### [MODIFY] [store.js](file:///c:/Users/ranie/.gemini/antigravity-ide/scratch/damayan-app/src/store.js)

Complete rewrite of the auth system with `localStorage` persistence:

- **`users[]`** — Registry of all accounts: `{ id, email, password, name, role, status, barangay, position, documentName, createdAt }`
